WEBVTT

00:12.480 --> 00:17.040
Thank you, Sister Wan'er risking yourself to save us, mother and son A transaction.

00:17.200 --> 00:18.600
Each has their needs.

00:21.200 --> 00:24.360
But I cannot go with you why?

00:24.440 --> 00:28.187
I am Prince Ning's most important trump card to threaten Your Highness.

00:29.080 --> 00:34.480
If the prince and I both disappear Prince Ning will search everywhere and find us.

00:35.040 --> 00:40.853
By then not only will we not be safe but you will also lose your life.

00:42.600 --> 00:47.120
Only if I stay will Prince Ning think his trump card remains.

00:56.560 --> 00:59.867
Take the prince away take good care of him.

01:02.160 --> 01:03.560
Thank you.

01:33.880 --> 01:36.120
March of the 24th year of Yuankang.

01:36.600 --> 01:41.040
Prince of Jin Sikong Yao led a great army to attack the capital Nandu.

01:41.120 --> 01:45.680
Facing this northern expedition army nandu's defenders were powerless to resist.

01:45.920 --> 01:49.440
After one day nandu fell.

02:04.320 --> 02:06.680
Xie Xuan where is your sister?

02:06.760 --> 02:08.160
Where is she?

02:12.440 --> 02:13.840
Where is she?

02:16.320 --> 02:18.653
I'm asking you, where is your sister?

03:26.920 --> 03:30.040
Miss why do you look so worried?

03:30.120 --> 03:35.440
Father insists I marry a prince I know Father has his reasons.

03:35.920 --> 03:38.920
But I've never even met this Prince of Jin.

03:39.240 --> 03:43.680
I really don't want to marry so blindly how about.

03:43.760 --> 03:45.427
I write you a note.

03:46.800 --> 03:51.800
Owed to my wife willow picking at Ba flower viewing at Yong'an.

03:53.880 --> 03:57.560
Kill.

04:05.880 --> 04:09.240
This is just my letter home why was it opened?

04:14.240 --> 04:16.720
This edict is fake.

04:48.000 --> 04:51.560
First wish long live my husband.

04:53.120 --> 04:54.520
Second wish.

04:55.400 --> 04:57.120
The prince always healthy.

04:58.760 --> 05:00.160
Third wish.

05:02.000 --> 05:03.880
Become swallows on the beam.

05:05.280 --> 05:07.120
Year after year.

05:08.360 --> 05:10.080
Always together.

05:16.800 --> 05:18.200
Ruolan.

05:20.840 --> 05:22.240
Yong'an flowers.

05:23.160 --> 05:24.560
This debt.

05:25.360 --> 05:27.160
I cannot collect.

05:29.120 --> 05:31.320
Ruolan.

06:24.040 --> 06:28.640
Prince of Jin Sikong Yao seeing me why don't you kneel?

06:29.320 --> 06:30.987
Drag him down for me.

06:32.920 --> 06:36.440
How dare you you you you.

06:45.120 --> 06:46.520
It was you.

06:48.160 --> 06:49.827
Who drove Ruolan to death.

06:54.160 --> 06:58.480
Sister-in-law sister-in-law, to avoid becoming my leverage against you.

06:59.240 --> 07:01.120
Already took her own life first.

07:02.200 --> 07:07.160
It was you Your ambition killed her.

07:07.840 --> 07:09.080
What?

07:09.160 --> 07:10.960
Thinking how to kill me?

07:11.520 --> 07:13.760
To ease the guilt in your heart?

07:19.040 --> 07:22.920
Let me think how will historians record you?

07:24.520 --> 07:26.240
Brothers fighting.

07:27.120 --> 07:31.320
Killing brother to seize the throne yao'er yao'er, stop.

07:32.280 --> 07:35.280
Yao'er yao'er, stop.

07:37.120 --> 07:41.360
Your elder brother spared you once Mother begs you.

07:42.160 --> 07:44.040
Spare him this time.

07:45.080 --> 07:48.720
You are flesh and blood brothers yao'er.

